{
  "slug": "sessions-dashboard",
  "name": "Sessions Dashboard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Live browser dashboard of every CLI agent session you're running on one screen. See what each session is doing in real time, organize them into named groups that persist across restarts, and jump straight to a session's terminal in one click (macOS / Windows + WezTerm).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `sessions-dashboard`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sessions-dashboard@claude-community` from `channyzf6/sessions-dashboard`.\n\nA live dashboard for every CLI agent session you're running — Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and Codex CLI on a single screen. See what each agent is doing in real time, organize sessions into groups, and jump straight to a session's terminal in one click.",
